</div>
<ul id="mwA5o"><li id="mwA5s"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Decimal_separator" title="Decimal separator" about="#mwt405" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwA5w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Annotated link ","href":"./Template:Annotated_link"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Decimal separator"}},"i":0}}]}'>Decimal separator</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt405"> </span><span about="#mwt405">– Numerical symbol</span></li>
